 "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179069324", "author": {"steamid": "76561198036988452", "personaname": "YippeeKiYayMF", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198036988452/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 111, "playtime_forever": 11567, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11567, "last_played": 1731805997, "avatar": "480b50403554ec96dc8007fd21602a3659b9d5bb"}, "language": "english", "review": "With 200 hours on the clock, I can finally share my thoughts. \n\nFrom the moment you start, Remnant 2 enchants you with its beauty and atmosphere. The world feels alive, the visuals are stunning, and the sound design is immersive—if only games had smells, i bed it would smell like forest ¯\\(ツ)/¯\n\nClasses feel distinct and rewarding to play with, each offering unique gameplay. \n", "timestamp_created": 1731684834, "timestamp_updated": 1736527394, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179040586", "author": {"steamid": "76561197988998862", "personaname": "FrozanOne", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197988998862/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 2512, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2512, "last_played": 1731407697, "avatar": "830e049b79a3d023bc3f71ed431613400cf95fdf"}, "language": "english", "review": "Hybrid exploration looter shooter. Fun solo and fun even more fun with friends.", "timestamp_created": 1731646314, "timestamp_updated": 1731646314, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179039158", "author": {"steamid": "76561198064978988", "personaname": "Loghead24", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Loghead24/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 2226, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 393, "last_played": 1757042574, "avatar": "1bdba51256f8f35751c348fc94fcefcde7b5680f"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is so much fun with a couple of friends. Souls-like with guns and a great variety of enemies and bosses. I really like the concept of fighting across many connected but different worlds. It feels fresh. I loved the first game up until the final boss fight, and so far I like this one even more.", "timestamp_created": 1731643847, "timestamp_updated": 1731643847, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}]}